WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.239
In under two minutes, you will enter your home in a neighborhood contest.

00:00:04.239 --> 00:00:05.276
We start on the map.

00:00:06.179 --> 00:00:09.511
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.286 --> 00:00:13.709
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:16.198
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.198 --> 00:00:17.544
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.297 --> 00:00:21.513
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.513 --> 00:00:22.164
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:28.219
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:29.436
See the three dots?

00:00:29.436 --> 00:00:29.984
Tap them.

00:00:31.593 --> 00:00:33.556
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:35.255 --> 00:00:37.310
Under Live now, tap Enter my home.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:42.419
If you are not signed in, the site asks you to sign in with Google or your email first.

00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:45.907
Add photos of your home.

00:00:45.907 --> 00:00:47.125
Tap Choose photos.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.984
The first photo is the cover.

00:00:50.965 --> 00:00:51.917
Tap Next.

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.763
Type your street address and ZIP code.

00:00:56.763 --> 00:00:57.799
Then tap Next.

00:01:01.174 --> 00:01:04.714
Choose the name to show, for example, The Kim family.

00:01:04.714 --> 00:01:05.632
Then tap Next.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:12.154
Tick the box to agree to the rules.

00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:13.834
Then tap Submit my entry.

00:01:16.604 --> 00:01:17.568
You are entered!

00:01:17.568 --> 00:01:20.970
The organizer reviews every entry before it goes on the map.

00:01:21.969 --> 00:01:24.860
Next up: Edit or withdraw your entry.
